There is a warning in the stock GUI after selecting the OpenWrt factory image, which displays V1.1.0.32, being older than the existing Netgear firmware (V1.2.0.16) in this case.

Installing the sysupgrade and upgrading to V23.05.2 installs and functions with no apparent issues.

Wireless performance substantially meets the test environment's available bandwidth of 200\20.

